                        <div id="student-faq-2" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                             aria-labelledby="student-faq-2-heading"
                             data-bs-parent="#studentFaqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                Each placement lists a set of required <strong>SFIA skills</strong> with levels
                                (1–7). You also list your skills and levels on your profile.
                                The system compares:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Which skills you have vs. which skills the placement needs.</li>
                                    <li>How close your level is to the required level.</li>
                                </ul>
                                For each required skill we calculate a partial score (e.g. 6/7 ≈ 86%) and then
                                average these to get an overall <strong>Match: X%</strong>.
                                100% doesn’t mean you’re guaranteed the role, but it does mean you closely match
                                what the employer asked for.
                            </div>
                        </div>
